  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EIB financing will support Cambodia&apos;s green recovery, by focusing on strengthening the agricultural value chains and facilitating the agricultural trade. The Bank&apos;s support will contribute to improving the agricultural productivity through modernised irrigation systems, food safety and certification and attracting private sector engagement in the value chains. Program co-financed alongside the International Fund for Agricultural Development and the Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia.</narrative>
